From 556249085f1cec8eeb93eb17888871912667e6ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:28:24 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: Files fixes from the phone; the same background as
 Broker

- Background: the screen, status bar (edge to edge, the root's background) and system bars
  use the theme's surface role, like every Plait app, instead of surfaceBright /
  surfaceContainer / a neutral tone; Places cards stay surfaceContainer
- Cut and Copy (with Paste here) instead of the Copy to / Move to destination picker, so
  there is one way to do each job
- One delete in the selection bar: "Delete" moves to the trash where there is one; Delete
  forever goes to More
- More sheet rows get design-guide icons (open with, info, rename, zip, ...)
- The picker's preview button is a small badge on the tile's bottom corner, clear of the check

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
